{"id":"00199","root":"uni00199_1","name":{"ja":"ミナサキ","en":"Minasaki"},"title":{"ja":"【純白と黒翼】","en":"【Pure White with Black Wings】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【純白と黒翼】 ミナサキ","en":"【Pure White with Black Wings】 Minasaki"},"element":"Spiritual","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2019-05-31","limited":true,"characterId":23,"profile":{"ja":"ヤタガラスの化身を名乗る少女。背中には黒い鳥の羽根が生えていて、一見すると堕天使のようにも見える。少し独占欲が強く、気に入ったものは自分のものにしたがる一方、自分のお気に入りを奪おうとする相手には容赦しない。気分屋で、何か必死にやっていたかと思うと、すぐに投げ出して別の事を始めていたりする。サキュバスのリリムとはいたずら仲間であり、しょっちゅうふうまにいたずらを仕掛けてくる困った存在。敵対心があるわけではなく、リリムと群れてふうまに構うのが楽しいようだ。街で見かけたウェディングドレスを気に入ったミナサキは、それを無理やり手に入れる。しかし、それは悪徳商人が政略結婚の相手に着せるために作った呪いのドレスだった。","en":"(Minasaki, she/her) She claims to be the incarnation of a night raven, a girl with black bird feathers sprouting from her back, giving her a fallen-angel appearance at first glance. She has a strong streak of possessiveness, eager to claim anything she likes as her own, yet shows no mercy to anyone who tries to snatch away her favorites. Her mood swings wildly—one moment she's throwing herself into a task, the next she abandons it for something else. She and the succubus Lilim are mischievous partners, constantly pulling pranks on Fuuma, a troublesome presence. They harbor no real hostility; they simply enjoy teasing Fuuma together. When Minasaki spots a wedding dress on the street, she decides she must have it, but the dress turns out to be a cursed garment crafted by a corrupt merchant for a political marriage."},"illustrator":"ほむらゆに","voiceActor":"葉月まぁち","forms":[{"id":"uni00199_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1132,2264],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[104,208],"def":[126,252],"spd":[74,74],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["3","210007"]},{"id":"uni00199_2","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1764,3528],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[143,286],"def":[187,374],"spd":[74,74],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["3","210007","210008"]},{"id":"uni00199_3","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[2396,4811],"sp":[300,300],"atk":[187,374],"def":[253,504],"spd":[74,74],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["3","210007","210008"]}],"skills":{"3":{"slot":"attack","id":3,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ダメージ"}},{"level":5,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ダメージ"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 100% Spiritual damage"}]},"210007":{"slot":"skill1","id":210007,"name":{"ja":"純白と黒翼"},"hits":3,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"ランダムな敵に極小威力で3回攻撃する"}},{"level":2,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"ランダムな敵に極小威力で3回攻撃する"}},{"level":3,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"ランダムな敵に極小威力で3回攻撃する"}},{"level":4,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"ランダムな敵に極小威力で3回攻撃する"}},{"level":5,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"ランダムな敵に極小威力で3回攻撃する"}}],"effects":[{"text":"Random enemies: 1 hits of 106% Spiritual damage"}]},"210008":{"slot":"skill2","id":210008,"name":{"ja":"ミナサキのドレス"},"hits":1,"cutin":true,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"味方全体のATKとDEFを中アップする"}},{"level":2,"sp":245,"detail":{"ja":"味方全体のATKとDEFを中アップする"}},{"level":3,"sp":240,"detail":{"ja":"味方全体のATKとDEFを中アップする"}},{"level":4,"sp":235,"detail":{"ja":"味方全体のATKとDEFを中アップする"}},{"level":5,"sp":230,"detail":{"ja":"味方全体のATKとDEFを中アップする"}}],"effects":[{"text":"All allies: ATK +40% for 4 turns","icon":"atk_up"},{"text":"All allies: DEF +40% for 4 turns","icon":"def_up"}]}},"leader":{"name":{"ja":"いい物ゲット♪"},"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ユニットのDEFを大アップ"},"effects":[{"text":"Spiritual allies: DEF +20%","icon":"def_up"}]},"abilities":[],"bloom":{"points":1,"gold":1,"status":1,"bonus":1,"items":[[1,"blo00002",80],[1,"blo00005",1],[2,"blo00007",15],[3,"blo00010",15],[4,"blo00013",15],[5,"blo00007",15],[6,"blo00010",15],[7,"blo00013",15],[8,"blo00007",15],[9,"blo00010",10],[9,"blo00011",10],[10,"blo00007",10],[10,"blo00008",10],[11,"blo00013",1